			29 05 00 1d e0 00 f0 00 0a 00 11 00 0b 00 0b 00 07 00 3c 00 44 00 52 00 09 00 16 00 15 00 31 00 34
			29 05 00 1d e1 00 f0 00 0a 00 11 00 0b 00 0b 00 07 00 3b 00 43 00 4f 00 08 00 15 00 15 00 2e 00 34
			29 00 00 03 f0 00 10
			29 00 00 03 f3 00 10
			29 00 00 03 e0 00 08
			29 00 00 03 e1 00 00
			29 00 00 03 e2 00 0c
			29 00 00 03 e3 00 00
			29 00 00 03 e4 00 e0
			29 00 00 03 e5 00 06
